@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050

### Create a selected-time reservation (09:00 Malaysia time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "slot-1",
  "userId": "user-7",
  "startUtc": "2026-08-13T01:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 120
}

### Find the longest free window in that fixed service day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/slots/slot-1/availability/longest?serviceDate=2026-08-13
Accept: application/json
